Gumshuda ki report
Shikayatkarta Ram Prakash Dubey pita Shri Hari Prakash Dubey, mob no 94O7 123 456.
Meri beti Ritu Dubey umra 17 saal, kad 5 feet, ne rang gehua, 06/09/2026 ko subah 8 baje school jane ke liye ghar se nikli lekin waapas nahi aayi. Shak hai ki Kamal Rajput (pados ka ladka) ne use bahla fusla kar le gaya hai. Uska number 7OO 111 2222 hai. Kamal ke paas MP O4 ZC 5O12 bike hai.
Dhara 363 IPC
IO: ASI Prem Singh
